  "description": "JOYSTAR Gemsbok 20\" Kids BMX Bike with Pegs\nUnleash their inner freestyle pro with the JOYSTAR Gemsbok. Designed for riders aged 7 and up, this 20-inch BMX combines a responsive entry-level geometry with a stunning vacuum-coated finish, making it the perfect partner for the sidewalk, dirt track, or skate park.\n\nBold style meets rugged performance: The Gemsbok in signature Oil Slick.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Built on a solid BMX platform to deliver emotion, experience, and excitement on two wheels, ensuring a responsive feel for every beginner rider.\"\nAdvanced Stopping Power\nSafety is our priority. The Gemsbok features a dual-handbrake system, including both front and rear caliper brakes. This adult-style setup provides precision speed control and double the safety protection compared to standard coaster brakes, preparing young riders for full-sized bicycles.\n\nPrecision dual caliper brakes for superior stopping power on all terrains.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nFreestyle Equipped: Includes two front pegs, allowing beginners to experiment with basic tricks and park riding.\n\nDurable Construction: A lightweight yet sturdy Hi-Ten steel frame designed to withstand the rigors of learning.\n\nGrows With Them: Features an adjustable comfort saddle and seat post for tool-free height adjustments as they grow.\n\nSmooth Stability: 20\" x 2.125\" wide pneumatic knobby tires provide the grip and stability needed for dirt paths and paved roads.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nWe know you're ready to ride. The Gemsbok arrives 85% pre-assembled. With the included tools and simplified instructions, your child will be out the door and on their new adventure in about 20 minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nBuild friendships and memories on every ride.\n\nWatch: Exploring the neighborhood and mastering the park with the Gemsbok.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR is committed to quality. Every bike is built to last and backed by our industry-leading support:\n\nLifetime Frame Warranty: Our steel frames are guaranteed for as long as the original purchaser owns the bike.\n\n2-Year Component Warranty: Protection against manufacturing defects on non-wear parts.\n\nReturn it in original condition within 30 days.",
